{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "b3e71bdd-6955-40ca-9aac-6e839e8e318e", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 2, "ts": "2026-07-22T17:16:12.224000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "read_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_clk_tree.c, /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_clk_tree.h, /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_cru.h, /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/include/nuttx/clk/clk.h", "tool_name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "db-read_file-1", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_clk_tree.c", "/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_clk_tree.h", "/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_cru.h", "/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/nuttx/include/nuttx/clk/clk.h"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "b3e71bdd-6955-40ca-9aac-6e839e8e318e", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 3, "ts": "2026-07-22T17:16:12.224000+00:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "改动完成。总结一下做了什么：\n\n1. **添加了 `#include <nuttx/clk/clk.h>`** — 引入 NuttX CLK 框架的 `clk_get()` 和 `clk_get_rate()` API。\n\n2. **在 `rk3576_clk_tree_initialize()` 之后添加了 GPLL 频率打印**：\n   - 调用 `clk_get(\"gpll\")` 获取 GPLL 时钟句柄\n   - 调用 `clk_get_rate()` 读取运行时频率（会实时从 PLL CON 寄存器计算）\n   - 以 Hz 和 MHz 两种单位打印，方便验证\n\n运行时你会在串口日志中看到类似：\n```\nINFO: GPLL rate = 1188000000 Hz (1188 MHz)\n```\n\n这样就能验证 `rk3576_clk_register_pll_factors` 中从 `GPLL_CON(0..2)` 寄存器计算出来的频率是否和 bootloader 配置的预期值一致。"}
